    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Attempts ending, per hour",
      "description": "Counted when the executor observes the transition, so nothing is lost to scrape timing. FAILED is counted even when a retry follows: the attempt did fail, and a job that failed twice and then succeeded ended three attempts.",
