      "title": "Event loop lag (p99)",
      "description": "Worth having precisely because this process runs the scheduler on the same event loop it serves the API from: \"the platform is slow\" and \"the event loop is blocked\" are the same graph. Every `ash predict` request goes through here too, which is one of the reasons it is not the serving path.",
